Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.65,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs90\pos(312.334,-13.666)}Real Cap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad brought this RC plane from America.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can match its speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Amesome! Let me fly the plane after you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna fly it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.29,0:00:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause you don't know how to fly a plane and you will surely crash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, if you want to fly a plane, buy it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.85,0:00:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Left
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.07,0:00:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm flying a fantastic RC plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:00:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get a real one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.78,0:01:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom won't buy me and I wanted one now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo's parents buy him everything he wants, I envy him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Down, my boy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.75,0:01:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That was sentimental
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.46,0:01:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I've got just the right thing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A RC plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Real Cap!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.52,0:01:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with a RC plane!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wear it and then you have to imagine whatever you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.77,0:01:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...and then it appears right in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.90,0:01:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A real RC plane?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.19,0:01:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's just the illusion and you'll be the only one who can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well damn that's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.78,0:01:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a try, I bet nothing's more fun having a RC plane
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.54,0:01:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to rack your brains, Nobita. The plane will soon appear in front of you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:01:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be better than Suneo's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as good
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well that's still your imagination Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This catalogue might be of use. Here you go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.91,0:02:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Think hard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.29,0:02:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is awesome...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.75,0:02:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can even feel the nozzle of the plane... the smell of the gasoline too, it's all too real!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.13,0:02:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You can remove the cap now, you can still see the RC plane
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for that! Wait, I'm gonna treat you to tons of Dorayaki... Hang on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:03:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this nice? A lifetime of Dorayaki
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.91,0:03:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't see anything... Only you imagined it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah right, I can see it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious! Nothing beats this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pity that you can't eat this, Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't resist myself eating the delicious Dorayaki! Gimme the cap~
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.73,0:03:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Very delicious
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.27,0:03:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, Please return it to me now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.69,0:03:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Bug off! I'm flyin' dis plane now and so be it! Aw dis is so fun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are. I can easily defeat Suneo's plane. Here we go
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Speed up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go round
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Attaboy, that's the way she flies
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.51,0:04:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I've done this! Hurray
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, whassup mate
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah well he's always in his own stupid world. I don't give a damn you know
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah I know right
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright time for something more interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Be ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Never dare to tease me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, wut's he doing now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone crazy I guess. I gotta go
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This cap is so awesome
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizu-chan, I've got something cool
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, isn't this cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always right
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right Nobi-san
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.46,0:05:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that awesome
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, cute teddy bear. Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.55,0:05:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizu-chan, why are you holding  your hands like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, what a cute panda. I used Nobita's cap
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Cute panda?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay, I cunt see anyding
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see this cute panda
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.15,0:05:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah just put on that cap Nobita's having, and all you have to do is think hard to get the stuff you want
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure? That cap?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.20,0:05:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oui nobita give me dat cap now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if he'd return it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.87,0:05:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:05:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a lion
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what you get when you don't obey me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I should have known that it has no effect on others
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright all i gutta do now is to think of all the stuff I need. That one...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow there dey come
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nicey-nicey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.41,0:06:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wrapping all of these and carrying them on my cycle home
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.92,0:06:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done with this! Give it to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.84,0:06:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! I've just borrowed it for a shurt time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet ya later guyz
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,WHAT
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant never returned back the Real Cap after he used it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah do something
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah dont worry, I'm bringing it back
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.27,0:07:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he never returns borrowed stuff. Time to teach him a lesson
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sleeping
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:28.46,Gadgets,,0,0,0,,Dinosaur Slippers and Megaphone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.71,0:07:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All ready, Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a Dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant is experiencing it real time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna have a hard time once he wakes up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:08:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's return now that we've retrieved real cap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay it was a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.53,0:08:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi stop chasing me! Leave me alone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alune!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with Giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's chasing Giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.79,0:08:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!! Leave me alone!
